  "body": "Direct-PR: README phase table stale (counts and states)\nAuthor model: Claude Sonnet 5.5\n\nProblem: the README phase table said 147 lots, \"32 of 65 engine lots done\", LOT-083 \"in review\" and 76 app lots. ROADMAP Phase 3 said \"23 of 55 engine lots done on 2026-10-27\".\n\nCause: counts were written by hand and not refreshed as lots merged.\n\nChanged (README Phase 1, 3, 4 cells and ROADMAP line 26 only):\n- Phase 1: 153 lots as of 2026-10-29.\n- Phase 3: 39 of 67 engine lots done.\n- Phase 4: LOT-083 merged; 6 of 75 app lots done; MVP lots still open: LOT-084 (PR #294), LOT-170 (PR #303), #300 (PR #309), LOT-161 (#251, not started).\n- ROADMAP Phase 3: 39 of 67.\nThe \"Nothing to install on a phone yet\" note stays true (LOT-161 open, no TestFlight build).\n\nCounts and sources (script reading docs/LOTS.md rows after merging dev-swift at ebc2743; \"done\" = linked issue closed with label `type: lot`, 51 closed):\n```\ntotal 153 done 51\nPhase 1 1 of 1\nPhase 2 5 of 5\nPhase 3 engine 39 of 67\nPhase 4 app 6 of 75   (4 first-usable-build rows + 71 parity rows)\nPhase 5 app 0 of 5\n```\n`python3 scripts/check-lot-deps.py`: 153 lots checked, 0 violations.\n\nCoordination: #313 (adds LOT-172/173, edits README Phase 1) is merged. dev-swift is merged into this branch and the conflicting Phase 1 cell was recomputed from LOTS.md (153), not taken from either side.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CHAtE1bjFGqCXryLBy",
